  "content": "<h2>描述</h2><p>基本模組資訊可於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查閱。</p><h2>修改內容</h2><p>1. 可重複搜尋建築結構，不會總是鎖定最新結構。您也可查看已搜尋結構的詳細資訊。\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgse.com%252fi%252fpEQEwe1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s21.ax1x.com/2025/02/19/pEQEwe1.png\" alt=\"pEQEwe1.png\"></a>\n2. 優化介面顯示更清晰，新增清除快取按鈕。使用後下次搜尋將鎖定最新生成的建築結構。\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgse.com%252fi%252fpEQE2yd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s21.ax1x.com/2025/02/19/pEQE2yd.png\" alt=\"pEQE2yd.png\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgse.com%252fi%252fpEQEROA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s21.ax1x.com/2025/02/19/pEQEROA.png\" alt=\"pEQEROA.png\"></a>\n3. 與Xaero小地圖連動。成功搜尋到建築結構時，會自動在Xaero小地圖上設定導航點。\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgse.com%252fi%252fpEQETfS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s21.ax1x.com/2025/02/19/pEQETfS.png\" alt=\"pEQETfS.png\"></a></p><h3>給整合包或資源包製作者</h3><p>在設定路徑中可找到檔案：<strong>/config/explorerscompass/config.json</strong>。\n可設定CustomModelData自訂模型資料，例如：\n<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">[{\"key\":\"minecraft:village_plains\",\"value\":10}, {\"key\": \"minecraft:village_desert\", \"value\": 20}]</span>\n當您找到符合該鍵值的結構時，物品的CustomModelData值會變更為對應數值。因此可透過custom_model_data自訂探險家羅盤的外觀與材質。詳細說明請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fTutorial%253aModels%2523Item_predicates\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><h2>整合包</h2><p>可以，您可將此模組用於您的整合包中。</p><h2>問題回報</h2><p>請勿在原模組頁面提交問題，您可在下方留言或至<a href=\"https://github.com/MCMostWolf/ExplorersCompassEdited/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>提交問題。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
